      "guidedPrayer": "Lord God of mercy, Your grace reaches deeper than my greatest failure. Forgive me for the hypocrisy that quickly judges the sins of others while secretly harboring my own compromises. Give me the courage of Judah to stop defending myself, to lay down my staff and signet, and to confess the truth when Your Spirit convicts me. Thank You that You do not discard broken people, but redeem our messy stories for Your glory. Let the breakthrough grace of Perez touch my family, and let Christ reign as the true Lion of Judah in my heart. In Jesus' name, Amen.",
