        "detail": "Pharaoh delayed his relief because pride hated surrendering to God. When the Holy Spirit convicts you of compromise, repent immediately—do not negotiate to keep sin for 'tomorrow.'",
        "question": "Is there an area of disobedience or compromise in your life that you have been putting off repenting of until 'tomorrow'?"
