      "guidedPrayer": "Lord God of hosts, You are greater than all the giants, higher than all fortified walls, and stronger than all the armies of darkness! Deliver me from the grasshopper complex of unbelief that looks at obstacles through the lens of human weakness. Give me the 'different spirit' of Caleb and Joshua—a spirit of bold, wholehearted trust that sees challenges as bread to strengthen my faith. When the crowd around me panics and speaks defeat, grant me the courage to stand firm upon Your promises. Thank You that You are with me, and under Your sovereign banner, no weapon formed against me can prosper. In Jesus' victorious name, Amen.",
