      "guidedPrayer": "Lord God of holiness, You are a consuming fire who demands pure, undivided allegiance. Cleanse my heart from the subtle seductions of modern-day Baal Peor—the idolatry of sensuality, compromise, and worldly tolerance. Plant within my spirit the holy zeal of Phinehas: a love that grieves over sin, a courage that refuses to stand idly by while evil spreads, and a passion to turn others away from iniquity. Thank You for Jesus Christ, our great High Priest, who took the spear of holy wrath in His own side on the cross to establish an everlasting covenant of peace for my soul. Let Your law of truth dwell in my mouth, and help me walk with You in peace and uprightness today. In Jesus' name, Amen.",
