        "detail": "The Commander answered: 'No; but I have come as commander of Yahweh's army.' True discipleship is not getting God to bless our agendas, but laying down our swords and surrendering unconditionally to His lordship.",
        "question": "Are you trying to enlist God to bless your personal plans, or asking Him: 'What does my Lord say to His servant?'"
