      "who": "Deborah ('Honeybee'), wife of Lappidoth, a prophetess and the fourth Judge of Israel, who held court under the Palm of Deborah in Ephraim, summoned General Barak to battle against Sisera's 900 iron chariots, and led Israel into glorious spiritual awakening.",
