      "who": "A mighty warrior from Gilead, the son of a harlot driven out by his legitimate half-brothers, who gathered a band of outlaws in Tob, was recalled by Gilead's elders to fight the Ammonites, and was empowered by the Holy Spirit—yet severely tainted by the pagan culture around him.",
