        "lesson": "True spiritual strength begins when self-reliance is completely demolished.",
        "verse": "Hebrews 11:34",
        "detail": "Samson achieved his greatest spiritual victory not when he was boasting in his youth, but when he acknowledged his absolute helplessness.",
        "question": "What areas of your life need to experience the death of self-reliance so God's strength can take over?"
