      "who": "Micah of the hill country of Ephraim, who stole silver from his mother, made a shrine with household idols, and hired an itinerant Levite as his personal priest; and the migrating Danites, who stole Micah's idols and priest to establish an illegitimate northern cult center at Laish (Dan).",
