      "who": "An unnamed Levite dwelling on the remote edges of Ephraim, whose travel through the Benjamite city of Gibeah exposed shocking moral depravity reminiscent of Sodom, sparking a horrific civil war that brought the tribe of Benjamin to the brink of total extinction.",
